# A fold's mark opens onto notes (scenes/about.seed.ts writes the notes and saves the screen): the bean rows have a
# comment thread and a proposed edit under them and no note, so their row has no mark; the seed list is opened, and
# the way to it unfolds (the screens' folder, whose mark opens onto its notes). The second reader was told no note:
# it is empty, and says what it is in its kind's own words.
bar.open scope=screens query=two-beds
bar.pick n=1
bar.open scope=search query="Seed list"
bar.pick n=1
